<title>INDIA: India Canfin Homes 96/97 net rises - PTI.</title>
<headline>India Canfin Homes 96/97 net rises - PTI.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Canfin Homes Ltd posted net profit of 121 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March) against 115.5 million in the previous year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company announced a dividend of 20 percent in 1996/97, PTI said without giving a comparative figure for 1995/96.  </p>
<p>The company made sanctions worth 1.31 billion rupees and disbursements of 1.03 billion in 1996/97, the news agency reported without giving comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
